## Why This Is Asked

Tests IPv6 end-to-end debugging in a practical setting.

## Key Concepts

- IPv6 path MTU discovery and 1280 MTU
- ICMPv6 and firewall behavior
- VPN MTU tuning
- IPv6 fallback strategies

## Code Example

```javascript
// Simple log parser to extract handshake timings
function parseHandshakeTimings(lines){
  const timings = [];
  for (const line of lines){
    const m = line.match(/TLS Handshake.*duration=(\\d+)/);
    if (m) timings.push(parseInt(m[1],10));
  }
  return timings;
}
```

